0xe4fccf3e9b0c1cb1bc1a583266a3a5db959b5010e81352f972d02f9651286616,2026-04-16 16:06:23.361,CA San Lorenzo de Almagro covers -1.5 spread vs CD Cuenca?,6,1776411000,t,"In the upcoming Copa Sudamericana game, scheduled for April 16 at 8:30 PM ET:
