0xf226e79dfd61e0b205e034c48892349c2c8061a3f30381b73ac57bc9c6702d0f,2026-04-16 16:06:23.356,Will both CR Flamengo and Independiente Medellín score?,6,1776411000,t,"In the upcoming Copa Libertadores game between CR Flamengo and Independiente Medellín, scheduled for April 16 at 8:30 PM ET:
This market will resolve to ""Yes"" if both CR Flamengo and Independiente Medellín each score at least one goal during the game.
This market will resolve to ""No"" if either team fails to score (i.e., if one or both teams finish with zero goals).
