0xf012c792dec2656433646dc6b1cf9bc5b0016e09ffacb7c8f28115b87fdf8143,2026-04-16 16:06:23.267,Will Nasdaq 100 (NDX) go up on April 16?,5,1776398340,t,"This market will resolve to ""Up"" if the official Nasdaq 100 Index closing price for Nasdaq 100 (NDX) on Thursday, April 16, 2026 is higher than the official Nasdaq 100 Index closing price for NDX on the most recent prior trading day.
